    "description": "This dataset contains the results of the experiment conducted to investigate the interplay between features of (Italian) idiomatic expressions and linguistic contexts in which the literal aspect of an idiom is relevant. The dataset includes two data files (\u201cres_all_items.csv,\u201d comprising all experimental items, including control items; \u201cres_idioms.csv,\u201d including only results for critical items) and a \"README.txt\" describing them in detail. In addition, the .Rmd file containing the codes to replicate the statistical analysis is provided.",
